---
---
<section id="about" class="scroll-mt-20 py-24 md:py-32 px-6 lg:px-16 bg-white">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-10 lg:gap-16 items-center about-content">
      <div>
        <h1 class="font-serif text-3xl md:text-5xl lg:text-6xl text-espresso uppercase leading-tight mb-6 scroll-reveal">Our Story</h1>
        <p class="text-lg mb-6">Founded in 2010, RANTY began with a simple vision: to create homes that perfectly balance architectural beauty with the natural environment.</p>
        <p class="mb-8">We believe that a home is more than just a structure. It's a sanctuary. Our team of architects, designers, and engineers work tirelessly to craft spaces that are not only visually stunning but also ergonomic, sustainable, and deeply personal to each client.</p>

      <!-- Scroll Velocity Marquee -->
      <div class="scroll-velocity-mb mb-8 overflow-hidden">
        <div class="scroll-velocity-track flex gap-8 whitespace-nowrap will-change-transform">
          <span class="text-espresso/20 font-serif text-2xl md:text-3xl uppercase tracking-widest">Crafting Homes Since 2010</span>
          <span class="text-terracotta font-serif text-2xl md:text-3xl uppercase tracking-widest">Architecture & Design</span>
          <span class="text-espresso/20 font-serif text-2xl md:text-3xl uppercase tracking-widest">Sustainable Living</span>
          <span class="text-terracotta font-serif text-2xl md:text-3xl uppercase tracking-widest">Ergonomic Spaces</span>
          <span class="text-espresso/20 font-serif text-2xl md:text-3xl uppercase tracking-widest">Crafting Homes Since 2010</span>
          <span class="text-terracotta font-serif text-2xl md:text-3xl uppercase tracking-widest">Architecture & Design</span>
          <span class="text-espresso/20 font-serif text-2xl md:text-3xl uppercase tracking-widest">Sustainable Living</span>
          <span class="text-terracotta font-serif text-2xl md:text-3xl uppercase tracking-widest">Ergonomic Spaces</span>
          <span class="text-espresso/20 font-serif text-2xl md:text-3xl uppercase tracking-widest">Crafting Homes Since 2010</span>
          <span class="text-terracotta font-serif text-2xl md:text-3xl uppercase tracking-widest">Architecture & Design</span>
          <span class="text-espresso/20 font-serif text-2xl md:text-3xl uppercase tracking-widest">Sustainable Living</span>
          <span class="text-terracotta font-serif text-2xl md:text-3xl uppercase tracking-widest">Ergonomic Spaces</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-3 gap-3 md:gap-6 border-t border-gray-300 pt-8">
          <div><h4 class="font-serif text-2xl md:text-4xl text-espresso italic"><span class="count-up-value" data-count="14" data-suffix="+">0</span></h4><p class="text-xs uppercase tracking-widest mt-1">Years</p></div>
          <div><h4 class="font-serif text-2xl md:text-4xl text-espresso italic"><span class="count-up-value" data-count="250" data-suffix="+">0</span></h4><p class="text-xs uppercase tracking-widest mt-1">Projects</p></div>
          <div><h4 class="font-serif text-2xl md:text-4xl text-espresso italic"><span class="count-up-value" data-count="12" data-suffix="m+">0</span></h4><p class="text-xs uppercase tracking-widest mt-1">Clients</p></div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="relative">
        <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1522071820081-009f0129c71c?ixlib=rb-4.0.3&auto=format&fit=crop&w=1000&q=80" alt="RANTY architecture team collaborating" class="rounded-3xl shadow-xl w-full h-[300px] md:h-[450px] lg:h-[600px] object-cover">
        <div class="absolute -bottom-4 md:-bottom-8 left-4 md:-left-8 bg-white p-4 md:p-6 rounded-2xl shadow-lg max-w-xs">
          <p class="font-serif text-xl text-espresso italic">"Building dreams, one home at a time."</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-32">
      <h2 class="font-serif text-2xl md:text-4xl text-espresso uppercase mb-8 md:mb-12 text-center">Milestones</h2>
      <div class="space-y-8 relative before:absolute before:inset-0 before:ml-5 before:-translate-x-px md:before:mx-auto md:before:translate-x-0 before:h-full before:w-0.5 before:bg-gradient-to-b before:from-transparent before:via-terracotta before:to-transparent">
        <div class="timeline-item relative flex items-center justify-between md:justify-normal md:odd:flex-row-reverse">
          <div class="timeline-circle flex items-center justify-center w-10 h-10 rounded-full border border-white bg-terracotta text-white shadow shrink-0 md:order-1 relative z-10">1</div>
          <div class="w-[calc(100%-4rem)] md:w-[calc(50%-2.5rem)] bg-white p-6 rounded-2xl shadow-sm border border-gray-100">
            <h3 class="font-serif text-xl text-espresso mb-1">2010 - The Beginning</h3>
            <p class="text-sm">RANTY was founded by a group of passionate architects.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="timeline-item relative flex items-center justify-between md:justify-normal md:odd:flex-row-reverse">
          <div class="timeline-circle flex items-center justify-center w-10 h-10 rounded-full border border-white bg-terracotta text-white shadow shrink-0 md:order-1 relative z-10">2</div>
          <div class="w-[calc(100%-4rem)] md:w-[calc(50%-2.5rem)] bg-white p-6 rounded-2xl shadow-sm border border-gray-100">
            <h3 class="font-serif text-xl text-espresso mb-1">2015 - First Major Award</h3>
            <p class="text-sm">Recognized for sustainable residential design.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="timeline-item relative flex items-center justify-between md:justify-normal md:odd:flex-row-reverse">
          <div class="timeline-circle flex items-center justify-center w-10 h-10 rounded-full border border-white bg-terracotta text-white shadow shrink-0 md:order-1 relative z-10">3</div>
          <div class="w-[calc(100%-4rem)] md:w-[calc(50%-2.5rem)] bg-white p-6 rounded-2xl shadow-sm border border-gray-100">
            <h3 class="font-serif text-xl text-espresso mb-1">2020 - 12 Million Customers</h3>
            <p class="text-sm">Reached a global milestone in custom home building.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
